diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/5515.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/5515.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3446e92
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/5515.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fix a crash when a custom ``--msg-template`` contains escaped braces (e.g.
+``{{ "Category": "{category}" }}``). Escaped braces are no longer interpreted
+as message fields.
+
+Closes #5515
